amientos Urbanos, para uso distinto de vivienda habitual y vinculado a una causa temporal concreta y acreditable.\\nEn consecuencia, el presente arrendamiento queda excluido de la normativa aplicable a zonas de mercado residencial tensionado, al no destinarse a residencia permanente.\\nEl arrendatario deber\u00E1 justificar documentalmente la causa de temporalidad con car\u00E1cter previo a la contrataci\u00F3n.\u201D\",\"location\":{\"visibility\":\"STREET\",\"municipality\":\"Bilbao\",\"district\":\"Deusto\",\"region\":\"Gran Bilbao\",\"province\":\"Bizkaia\",\"address\":{\"streetName\":\"Lehendakari Aguitte\",\"streetNumber\":null},\"coordinates\":{\"latitude\":43.27651146154311,\"longitude\":-2.9597624342690096},\"displayAddressLine\":\"Lehendakari Aguitte\",\"displayZoneLine\":\"Deusto, Bilbao\",\"layers\":[{\"type\":\"neighbourhood\",\"value\":\"Ibarrekolanda\",\"slug\":\"ibarrekolanda\"},{\"type\":\"country\",\"value\":\"Espa\u00F1a\",\"slug\":\"espana\"},{\"type\":\"autonomous_community\",\"value\":\"Pa\u00EDs Vasco\",\"slug\":\"pais-vasco\"},{\"type\":\"province\",\"value\":\"Bizkaia\",\"slug\":\"bizkaia\"},{\"type\":\"region\",\"value\":\"Gran Bilbao\",\"slug\":\"gran-bilbao\"},{\"type\":\"area\",\"value\":\"Bilbao, Zona de\",\"slug\":\"bilbao-zona-de\"},{\"type\":\"municipality\",\"value\":\"Bilbao\",\"slug\":\"bilbao\"},{\"type\":\"district\",\"value\":\"Deusto\",\"slug\":\"deusto\"},{\"type\":\"street\",\"value\":\"Calle Larrakotorre\",\"slug\":\"calle-larrakotorre\"},{\"type\":\"street\",\"value\":\"Calle Mar Mediterraneo\",\"slug\":\"calle-mar-mediterraneo\"},{\"type\":\"street\",\"value\":\"Calle Navarro Villoslada\",\"slug\":\"calle-navarro-villoslada\"},{\"type\":\"street\",\"value\":\"Calle Arturo Campion\",\"slug\":\"calle-arturo-campion\"},{\"type\":\"street\",\"value\":\"Calle Luis Braille\",\"slug\":\"calle-luis-braille\"},{\"type\":\"street\",\"value\":\"Calle Erdikoetxe\",\"slug\":\"calle-erdikoetxe\"},{\"type\":\"street\",\"value\":\"Calle 