lanta-intermedia/basurtu-kastrexana-errepidea/basurtu-zorrotza/bilbao/13281095-6d4b-47af-8a07-cbce13762e0d/d\",\"feature\":null,\"short\":\"/a/13281095-6d4b-47af-8a07-cbce13762e0d\"}},{\"id\":\"4d056ed4-7e9c-4b32-ae3b-6eb8d0272ae9\",\"reference\":\"3167\",\"legacyNumericId\":\"38192000002181\",\"kind\":\"secondHand\",\"navigationUrl\":\"/alquiler/planta-intermedia/arechaga-kalea/ibaiondo/bilbao/4d056ed4-7e9c-4b32-ae3b-6eb8d0272ae9/d\",\"listingNavigationUrl\":\"/alquiler/plantas-intermedias/bizkaia-provincia/bilbao/ibaiondo/s\",\"summary\":{\"title\":\"SE ALQUILA VIVIENDA TEMPORAL RECIEN REFORMADA ENFRENTE DEL MERCADO DE LA RIBERA\",\"description\":\"Se alquila vivienda reformado al detalle, ALQUILER TEMPORAL muy luminosa, cocina equipada con lavadora, gran sal\u00F3n con mirador espectacular, T. V con un sofa grande y calefacci\u00F3n suelo radiante.Esta preciosa vivienda cuenta con dos 2 habitaciones enfrente de mercado de la Ribera y parada de tranv\u00EDa, esta a 7 minutos del metro casco viejo. Est\u00E1n en la Zona del Marzana con un mont\u00F3n de restaurantes y ocio en la zona.Disponibles 1 habitaci\u00F3n con dos camas individuales de 90 x 1,80 y Otra habitaci\u00F3n con cama de 1,60 X 1,90 con ba\u00F1o en suite.\\r\\n(((El presente arrendamiento se formaliza como un contrato de temporada (uso distinto de vivienda), el cual se rige estrictamente por el Art\u00EDculo 3 de la Ley de Arrendamientos Urbanos (LAU).Al tratarse de un r\u00E9gimen de temporada y no de un alquiler de vivienda habitual, no aplica la exenci\u00F3n de honorarios para el arrendatario estipulada en el art\u00EDculo 20.1 de la LAU (modificado por la Ley por el Derecho a la Vivienda). Por tanto, los honorarios por los servicios de gesti\u00F3n e intermediaci\u00F3n inmobiliaria corresponden y ser\u00E1n abonados \u00EDntegramente por el inquilino.)))\",\"location\":{\"visibility\":\"STREET\",\"municipality\":\"Bilbao\",\"district\":\"Ibaiondo\",\"region\":\"Gran Bilbao\",\"province\":\"Bizkaia\",\"address\":{\"streetName\":\"Arechaga Kalea\",\"streetNumber\":\"1\"},\"coordinates\":{\"latitude\":43.25520819305587,\"longitude\":-2.9267468251680384},\"displayAddressLine\":\"Arechaga Kalea\",\"displayZoneLine\":\"Ibaiondo, Bilbao\",\"layers\":[{\"type\":\"neighbourhood\",\"value\":\"San Francisco\",\"slug\":\"san-francisco\"},{\"type\":\"country\",\"value\":\"Espa\u00F1a\",\"slug\":\"espana\"},{\"type\":\"autonomous_community\",\"value\":\"Pa\u00EDs Vasco\",\"slug\":\"pais-vasco\"},{\"type\":\"province\",\"value\":\"Bizkaia\",\"slug\":\"bizkaia\"},{\"type\":\"region\",\"value\":\"Gran Bilbao\",\"slug\":\"gran-bilbao\"},{\"type\":\"area\",\"value\":\"Bilbao, Zona de\",\"slug\":\"bilbao-zona-de\"},{\"type\":\"municipality\",\"value\":\"Bilbao\",\"slug\":\"bilbao\"},{\"type\":\"district\",\"value\":\"Ibaiondo\",\"slug\":\"ibaiondo\"},{\"type\":\"street\",\"value\":\"Calle Miribilla\",\"slug\":\"calle-miribilla\"},{\"type\":\"street\",\"value\":\"Calle San Francisco\",\"slug\":\"calle-san-francisco\"},{\"type\":\"street\",\"value\":\"Calle Cortes\",\"slug\":\"calle-cortes\"},{\"type\":\"street\",\"value\":\"Calle Conde Mirasol\",\"slug\":\"calle-conde-mirasol\"},{\"type\":\"street\",\"value\":\"Calle Concepcion\",\"slug\":\"calle-concepcion\"},{\"type\":\"street\",\"value\":\"Muelle la Merced\",\"slug\":\"muelle-la-merced\"},{\"type\":\"street\",\"value\":\"Calle Mina San Luis\",\"slug\":\"calle-mina-san-luis\"},{\"type\":\"street\",\"value\":\"Puente la Ribera\",\"slug\":\"puente-la-ribera\"},{\"type\":\"street\",\"value\":\"Calle Olano\",\"slug\":\"calle-olano\"},{\"type\":\"street\",\"value\":\"Calle Martzana\",\"slug\":\"calle-martzana\"},{\"type\":\"street\",\"value\":\"Plaza Corazon de Maria\",\"slug\":\"plaza-corazon-de-maria\"},{\"type\":\"street\",\"value\":\"Calle Vitoria-Gasteiz\",\"slug\":\"calle-vitoria-gasteiz\"},{\"type\":\"street\",\"value\":\"Calle Arechaga\",\"slug\":\"calle-arechaga\"},{\"type\":\"street\",\"value\":\"Muelle Martzana\",\"slug\":\"muelle-martzana\"}],\"country\":\"Espa\u00F1a\",\"autonomousCommunity\":\"Pa\u00EDs Vasco\",\"postalCode\":\"48003\",\"geography\":[{\"level\":\"country\",\"code\":\"724\"},{\"level\":\"autonomous-community\",\"code\":\"18\"},{\"level\":\"province\",\"code\":\"48\"},{\"level\":\"region\",\"code\":\"420\"},{\"level\":\"area\",\"code\":\"791\"},{\"level\":\"municipality\",\"code\":\"48020\"},{\"level\":\"district\",\"code\":\"2030\"},{\"level\":\"neighbourhood\",\"code\":\"649\"}]},\"multimedia\":{\"images\":[{\"type\":null,\"url\":\"https://static.fotocasa.es/images/ads/a270d97e-d3d2-4ce9-ba93-a3733dc1b4eb?rule=original\",\"position\":null},{\"type\":null,\"url\":\"https://static.fotocasa.es/images/ads/8346dc0f-8311-4394-b655-8058c82c4d46?rule=original\",\"position\":null},{\"type\":null,\"url\":\"https://static.fotocasa.es/images/ads/95721d13-a65c-4c29-8d84-a0ff35de5274?rule=original\",\"position\":null},{\"type\":null,\"url\":\"https://static.fotocasa.es/images/ads/d45c5a59-2fa0-4b1c-b243-9774cfdac647?rule=original\",\"position\":null},{\"type\":null,\"url\":\"https://static.fotocasa.es/images/ads/cc964dc8-fe5d-468d-a3cf-a5785a16f52d?rule=original\",\"position\":null},{\"type\":null,\"url\":\"https://static.fotocasa.es/images/ads/c3727942-f2c6-419a-ae76-df95a956a14f?rule=original\",\"position\":null},{\"type\":null,\"url\":\"https://static.fotocasa.es/images/ads/2c8228d5-a867-4c0a-9603-9a155b865ff7?rule=original\",\"position\":null},{\"type\":null,\"url\":\"https://static.fotocasa.es/images/ads/f358be92-5b32-463c-855d-bff03a55edd0?rule=original\",\"position\":null},{\"type\":null,\"url\":\"https://static.fotocasa.es/images/ads/740f756e-4cde-43ce-9b35-caceaa968db8?rule=original\",\"position\":null},{\"type\":null,\"url\":\"https://static.fotocasa.es/images/ads/a272dd2e-68e5-4c32-848e-d3a3cb4981c3?rule=original\",\"position\":null},{\"type\":null,\"url\":\"https://static.fotocasa.es/images/ads/68e8b9fd-477e-49e8-9176-000d1f622711?rule=original\",\"position\"